"The **Default Controller** is a special controller that is used when a "
"URI ends with a directory name or when a URI is not present, as will be "
"the case when only your site root URL is requested."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/incoming/auto_routing_improved.rst:258
msgid "By default, the Default Controller is ``Home``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/incoming/auto_routing_improved.rst:260
msgid ""
"Define only the default method (``getIndex()`` for GET requests) in the "
