msgid "Fallback to Default Controller"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/incoming/auto_routing_improved.rst:294
msgid ""
"If the controller corresponding to the URI segment of the controller name"
" does not exist, and if the default controller (``Home`` by default) "
"exists in the directory, the remaining URI segments are passed to the "
"default controller's default method."
msgstr ""

