msgstr ""

#: ../../source/incoming/auto_routing_improved.rst:341
msgid ""
"You cannot have directories with the same name in **app/Controllers** and"
" **public**. This is because if there is a directory, the web server will"
" search for it and it will not be routed to CodeIgniter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/incoming/auto_routing_improved.rst:346
msgid ""
"Each of your sub-directories may contain a default controller which will "
"be called if the URL contains *only* the sub-directory. Simply put a "
"controller in there that matches the name of your default controller as "
"specified in your **app/Config/Routing.php** file."
